  "description": "23 MONIVEA PARK, GALWAY – \n\nCreate Real Estate are delighted to offer 23 Monivea Park to the rental market.\n\nA beautifully modernised and energy-efficient 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom home located in a quiet, established residential area of Galway City.\n\nThis property has undergone a recent renovation, bringing it up to an impressive BER B rating for low energy bills and high comfort year-round.\n\nThis property offers comfortable accommodation in a convenient and established residential location, making it an ideal home for tenants seeking easy access to Galway City and the surrounding areas.\n\nProperty Features:\n\nBrand New Kitchen & Dining: Contemporary navy shaker units featuring quartz counter tops, a sleek breakfast bar with stool seating, subway tile splashbacks, and tiled flooring. Extra under stair storage also installed. \n\nEnergy Efficient: Fully re-insulated attic and brand-new triple-glazed energy-efficient windows and doors.\nSpacious Living Spaces: Bright, airy layout with modern decor.\n\nExterior: Low-maintenance exterior with a private driveway offering off-street parking, and nice sized private back garden.\n\nMonivea Park is located within easy reach of a wide range of amenities, including shops, schools, services and recreational facilities. Galway City Centre is also readily accessible.\n\nMinutes from Parkmore & Ballybrit Business Parks, ATU (formerly GMIT), and Merlin Park Hospital.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nStrictly by appointment only. Please submit an email enquiry with your details and references to arrange a viewing.\n\nPlease contact STANLEY KELLY to arrange a private viewing.\n",
